# messages/ 国际化语言文件示例

> 两个语言文件必须成对维护，键名与层级保持一致：新增文案时两份都要加。

## messages/zh-CN.json

{
  "HomePage": {
    "title": "{{ project_name }}",
    "subtitle": "{{ description }}"
  }
}

## messages/en.json

{
  "HomePage": {
    "title": "{{ project_name }}",
    "subtitle": "{{ description_en }}"
  }
}
